    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle to Become the Ultimate Bungo Champion</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>These Bungos are not messing around</u></strong><u> </u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bash, dash and smash other players in exhilarating fights that will push your skills to the test! Bungo Bash balances competitive play and wacky fun. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160920/extras/2747086494fc1ea8c3baabec6e8ac68b.poster.avif?t=1754275106\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160920/extras/2747086494fc1ea8c3baabec6e8ac68b.webm?t=1754275106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160920/extras/2747086494fc1ea8c3baabec6e8ac68b.mp4?t=1754275106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u> <strong>Choose your Bungo</strong> </u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bingo, you can can pick from a dynamic roster of characters with lots of unique abilities and playstyles to master. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160920/extras/191e1ab3863502d0649f02abdb930e33.poster.avif?t=1754275106\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160920/extras/191e1ab3863502d0649f02abdb930e33.webm?t=1754275106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160920/extras/191e1ab3863502d0649f02abdb930e33.mp4?t=1754275106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Fight your friends</u></strong><u> </u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PVP battles online or locally in a plethora of unique game modes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160920/extras/765e81e50a09845334a6ff0272ec6efa.poster.avif?t=1754275106\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160920/extras/765e81e50a09845334a6ff0272ec6efa.webm?t=1754275106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160920/extras/765e81e50a09845334a6ff0272ec6efa.mp4?t=1754275106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle to Become the Ultimate Bungo Champion</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>These Bungos are not messing around</u></strong><u> </u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bash, dash and smash other players in exhilarating fights that will push your skills to the test! Bungo Bash balances competitive play and wacky fun. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160920/extras/2747086494fc1ea8c3baabec6e8ac68b.poster.avif?t=1754275106\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160920/extras/2747086494fc1ea8c3baabec6e8ac68b.webm?t=1754275106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160920/extras/2747086494fc1ea8c3baabec6e8ac68b.mp4?t=1754275106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u> <strong>Choose your Bungo</strong> </u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bingo, you can can pick from a dynamic roster of characters with lots of unique abilities and playstyles to master. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160920/extras/191e1ab3863502d0649f02abdb930e33.poster.avif?t=1754275106\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160920/extras/191e1ab3863502d0649f02abdb930e33.webm?t=1754275106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160920/extras/191e1ab3863502d0649f02abdb930e33.mp4?t=1754275106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Fight your friends</u></strong><u> </u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PVP battles online or locally in a plethora of unique game modes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160920/extras/765e81e50a09845334a6ff0272ec6efa.poster.avif?t=1754275106\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160920/extras/765e81e50a09845334a6ff0272ec6efa.webm?t=1754275106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160920/extras/765e81e50a09845334a6ff0272ec6efa.mp4?t=1754275106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "A platform fighter that is fully 3D! Use your powerful abilities to knock other players out of the stage. The more attacks you land the farther they go!! Online or local PVP battles across vibrant stages in the world of Bungalow.",
